      "reason": "Two complete current-derating modules are separate copies: SLX SIDs 35->36->37->38->44 and 39->40->41->42->45 both implement I = 300 * clip((stop - x) * gain, 0, 1). The first uses SOC with (stop, gain) = (1, 5); the second uses temperature with (50, 0.1). Both outputs are in A and feed SID46 / Block37 inputs 2 and 3 for the common minimum-current limit. model.json lines 332-369, 372-409, 423-441 and 443-453 describe the same chains. No SubSystem, Library Link or Model Reference encapsulates them; unique permission-debounce and current-ramp logic does not remove this duplicated reusable algorithm.",
